    <string name="hint_widget">How it works:\n\n• Master ON — ACC controls charging (needs root). Master OFF — normal unrestricted charge.\n• Hysteresis: charge until Stop %% (pause), then stay off until level falls to Resume %% or below.\n• Max current (up to 3000 mA) limits charge rate in normal mode. Smart mode may use up to 2000 mA on its own grid.\n• Smart (one-shot): starting N minutes before the deadline, charge to the target %%. After the target or deadline, smart turns off and hysteresis returns.\n• Add ACC Charge widgets to the home screen; tap a widget to open settings.</string>
